<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 23.30 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 23.30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose by 37.5 basis points to 23.30 percent for June 24, from 22.925 percent on June 23, Banco de Mexico said on Monday.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is revised each trading day.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
